Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:41.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（芝加哥 伊利诺斯州）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:49.10,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:54.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一周后）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.15,0:26:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[咒语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[CHANTING lN FOREIGN LANGUAGE]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on Supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 这次比你以前遇到的都要麻烦 它们无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam This is bigger than you think. They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他想我们继续他的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拯救人类 猎杀恶魔 家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people. Hunting things. The family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真不能理解你对他的盲目信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand the blind faith you have in the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你他妈的是个混蛋 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a selfish bastard, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只是做你自己想做的 而不管别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就要开车了 你会被抛弃在这 听到没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm taking off. I will leave your ass, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这正是我想要你做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I want you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.31,0:00:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你将出发去哪里呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我不会告诉你的 - 为什么不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way l'm telling you. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能是个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be some kind of freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可没道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把他们都抓住 怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I could've taken them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么让他们走掉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why let them go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.27,0:02:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}系统启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}System disarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.61,0:02:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}系统锁定\N{\fnArial\fs30}System armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好梅雷迪思 我是克里斯汀 你一定得和我说说昨天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Meredith, it's Kristen. You have to tell me what happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记得回电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 梅雷迪思 我是德里克 你去哪里了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Meredith. It's Derrick. Where you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一整天都在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried to get you all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有些有意思的东西给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause I got maybe something's gonna pleseyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.53,0:03:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猜猜是什么 到家后给我回电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what.Call mewhen you come back, ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想知道答案的话 给我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf you wanna solve that mystery, call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吗？再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.33,0:03:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 梅雷迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 别说我没挺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, don't say I don't got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道上次那家伙伤透了你的心 不过这次这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that guy ripped your heart out last time, but this one…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和老爸没有那些愚蠢的持卡人 也能利用信用卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta say Dad and me did just fine without these stupid costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.39,0:04:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我感觉自己像个戏剧学院的学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like a high school drama dork.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你演出那场叫什么来着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that play that you did? That.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}表演的不错 你也很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it? Our Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.43,0:04:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 你到底有完没完？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna pull this off, or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想说开支很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying these outfits cost hard earned money, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.69,0:04:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁的开支？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.77,0:04:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为盗用信用卡很简单？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think credit card fraud's easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你让我们进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for letting us look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察说他们已经检查了这个地方 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, police said they were done with the place, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是那个报警器公司的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys said you're with the alarm company?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.95,0:05:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无意冒犯 但你们的报警器真没什么作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no offense, but your alarm's about as useful as boobs on a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我们来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看为什么不起作用 防止此类事件再次发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what went wrong, stop it from happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大妈 你发现的尸体？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, madam, you found the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是刚刚发生惨案后吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right after it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.75,0:05:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 过了些日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Few days later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅雷迪思的老板打来电话 她没来上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meredith's work called, she hadn't showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来敲她的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knocked on her door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个时候我发现很难闻的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I noticed the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有打开的窗吗 搏斗的痕迹呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any windows open? Any sign of break in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}窗户都紧闭着 门也是插上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, windows were locked. Door was bolted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.01,0:05:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}锁链还在门上呢 为了进来 我还把它切断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chain was on the door. We had to cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报警器还开着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the alarm was still on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像我抱怨的 你公司的东西真的不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said bang up job your company's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有没有看到翻倒的家具 打破的玻璃 搏斗的痕迹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see any overturned furniture? Broken glass? Struggle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的东西都完好… 除了梅雷迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was in perfect condition. Except Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅雷迪思 她怎么了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what condition was Meredith in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.61,0:05:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅雷迪思被撕碎了 满地都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meredith was all over. In pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀害她的凶手一定充满力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy who killed her must have been a wack job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我想说 如果不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I'll tell you, if I didn't know any better,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就一定是野生动物所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have said a wild animal did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大妈 你介意我们花点时间 再把这个地方做个彻底检查？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, you mind if we take some time, give this place a once over?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出去的时候锁上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个凶手出入了这间房子 没有武器 没有指纹 什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the killer walks in and out of the apartment. No weapons, no prints.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说实话 当我看到报道的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you the minute I found that article.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.18,0:06:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就知道这是我们该解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew this was our kind of gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.31,0:06:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.13,0:06:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和警察谈过了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you talked to the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我和艾米谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah. Spoke to Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.61,0:06:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个迷人的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}A charming, perky officer of the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你查到些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她属人马座的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she's a Sagittarius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她喜欢龙舌兰酒 我是指\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loves tequila. I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她还有些小的纹身图案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and she's got this tattoo, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.17,0:06:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.56,0:06:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 没有什么新的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Nothing we don't already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了他们没有报道在报纸上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for one thing they're keeping out of the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅雷迪思的心脏被挖走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meredith's heart was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:06:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 她的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得是什么东西干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房东太太说像是动物的袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}The landlady said it looked like an animal attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人狼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.77,0:07:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是 月的轨道不符合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a werewolf.The lunar cycle's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.46,0:07:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果它是个生物 就一定会留下痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, if it was a creature, it would've left some kind of trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定是个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably a spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮我找找看有没有黑胶带\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you can find any masking tape around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前看到过这个符号吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever see that symbol before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:08:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的？你做体操运动员五年了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? You were a gymnast for five years?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 来酒吧帮帮忙 - 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help here at the bar. - Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和吧台的招待谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talked to the bartender.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了她的电话 你还得到些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get anything?Besides her number.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.12,0:08:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟 我可是专业人士 你可不能那么说我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. I'm a professional. I'm offended that you would think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能不能用用你的大脑 迪恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind doing a little bit of thinking with your upstairs brain, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.07,0:08:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里也没什么可查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? There's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅雷迪思在这里工作 她是个招待而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meredith worked here. She waited tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的人都是她的朋友 别人也说她很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone here is her friend. They say she's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死前她也没说过什么古怪的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't do or say anything weird before she died. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个符号呢？你查到些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that symbol? Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸的日记 一般的书本上都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't in Dad's journal or any of the usual books.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想 我得花点工夫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So l'll just have to dig a little deeper, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在梅雷迪思之前 第一个牺牲者情况呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a victim before Meredith?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.55,0:09:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 他的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah. His name was…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}名字是本·斯沃斯托姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Ben Swardstrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上个月他在家里发现被杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was mutilated. Same deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.78,0:09:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同样的情况 门被锁上了 警报器还开着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door was locked, the alarm was on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这两者有联系吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls there any connection between them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在还没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I can tell. I mean, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本是个银行人士 梅雷迪思是个女招待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben was a banker, Meredith was a waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们没见过对方 是两个来自不同世界的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never met, never knew anyone in common. From different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我们唯一成功的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the only successful intel we've scored so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拿到了吧台招待的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the bartender's phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.74,0:09:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 是你吗 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, is that you? Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:09:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在这里干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚到这里 拜访朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just in town visiting friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你朋友在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不在这里 那么你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're not here right now. But what about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅格 我还以为你去了加州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg. You were going to California.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去过 看过 征服过\N{\fnArial\fs30}l came, I saw, I conquered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚和那个什么家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and I met what's his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫麦克或莫里什么的 在这个吧里聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something Michael Murray, at a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别管\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且也有点厌倦了 所以我在这里住一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, the whole scene got old. So l'm living here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.74,0:10:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从芝加哥来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're from Chicago?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是 是麻省 到这里结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Massachusetts. Andover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们又见面 这一切太神奇了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the odds we'd run into each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.37,0:10:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也觉得 我还以为再也见不到你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. I thought I'd never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, l'm glad you were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.23,0:10:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 咳嗽时捂着嘴 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. Cover your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思 梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, l'm sorry, Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是 这是我哥哥迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is… This is my brother, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就是迪恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 你听说过我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So you've heard of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我当然听说过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. I've heard of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:11:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 你对你弟弟就像对行李一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice, the way you treat your brother like luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.07,0:11:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.58,0:11:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么不让他去做他喜欢的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him do what he wants to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别再老拽着他不放好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop dragging him over God's green earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅格 现在没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.83,0:11:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挺尴尬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.83,0:11:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去喝点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get a drink now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是想起他以前怎么对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the way you told me he treats you…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果换了是我 我会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf it were me, l'd kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在没事了 他没什么恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. He means well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还在城里的时候 我们该聚聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should hook up while you're in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.93,0:11:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要带你到处逛逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show you a hell of a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来不错 不如你把电话给我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. Why don't you give me your number.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}312- 555- 0143\N{\fnArial\fs30}312-555-0143.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从不知道你的姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I never got your last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马斯特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.51,0:11:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人格担保\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scout's honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.75,0:11:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望能再看到你 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope to see you around, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell was she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不太清楚 只见过她一次而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really know. I only met her once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和她再次相见？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meeting up with her again…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 兄弟 这太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man, it's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她刚才说什么 我把你当行李？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what was she saying? I treat you like luggage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.31,0:12:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当着这个婊子说我坏话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, were you bitching about me to a chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我很抱歉 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. I'm sorry. Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那次我们吵的很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was when we had that fight when I was in that bus stop in Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是印地安那停车站的那次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.39,0:12:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说的是真的吗？我让你违背自己的意愿了 萨姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any truth to it? Am I keeping you against your will?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 当然不是 你能不能听我说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not. Now, would you listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.82,0:12:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得这里面有古怪 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something strange going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.81,0:12:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就和我说说看 我没把她当回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about it. She wasn't that into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 兄弟 我是指就像所有奇怪的事情一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. I mean our kind of strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这是个线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么那么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几星期前我在路边遇到了梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}l met Meg weeks ago on the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我却在一个芝加哥的酒吧见到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I run into her in some Chicago bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同一个酒吧 而这里的一个招待被某种鬼魂杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bar where a waitress was slaughtered by something supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.43,0:12:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你认为这很奇怪吗？- 经常会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Think that's weird? - Coincidence. It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 是经常发生 可不会在我们身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, it happens. But not to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.84,0:12:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 也许我会弄错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我觉得有些古怪令我不能平常的对待这个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}, but there's something about her. That I can't quite put my finger on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.27,0:12:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我打赌你想那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}l bet you'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许她并不是嫌疑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she's not a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你想和她有点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a thing for her, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你用脑子过分了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're thinking a little too much with the upstairs brain. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮我查查是否有个梅格·马斯特斯从麻省来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check if there's really a Meg Masters from Andover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.07,0:13:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也查查关于那个符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}. See if you can dig anything up on that symbol on Meredith's floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你去做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去监视梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm gonna watch Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想看看究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wanna see what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 你有点反常哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better safe. You little pervert. Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走了 我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm going, l'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 - 你正潜伏在那个女孩的住所外面 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - You're lurking outside her apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:13:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的反应真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny way of showing your affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:14:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你找到关于她的资料没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything on her or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她检查了 这里电话本上有位梅格·马斯特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She checks out. There's a Masters in the phone book.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我甚至查到了她的高中照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled up her high school photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 你为什么不去敲她的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go knock on her door…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和她来段浪漫的诗歌阅读呢 或着做点其它什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and invite her to a poetry reading or whatever it is you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个符号呢？找到些什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the symbol? Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 这次我运气不错 好象是和索罗亚斯德教有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did have some luck. It's… Turns out it's Zoroastrian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常古老的教派 还远在基督诞生前2000多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very, very old school, like 2000 years before Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.06,0:14:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个关于恶魔daeva的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a sigil for a Daeva.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么是daeva？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a Daeva?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}翻译过来就是「暗黑魔王」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Translates to "demon of darkness."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索罗亚斯德教描述的魔鬼 凶残兽性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoroastrian demons. And they're savage, animalistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.75,0:14:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令人厌恶的 就跟比特斗犬一样凶狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, nasty attitudes. Kind of like demonic pit bulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么查到的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you figure that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我的信用 你不用像我呆在一堆书里搜索这一切 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me credit.l can chase paper too. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.28,0:14:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我你查的最后一本书的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name the last book you read.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和爸爸的朋克莱博通电话 是他告诉我这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called Caleb, he told me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.51,0:14:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且还有些事情 这些daeva是被召唤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Here's the thing, Daevas they have to be summoned, conjured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.18,0:14:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以有人在操纵它们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So someone's controlling it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.69,0:14:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 正是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what l'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从我查到的资料来看 这也是比较危险的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I gather, it's pretty risky too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些鬼魂会吃掉手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tend to bite the hand that feeds them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:14:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胳膊 甚至 躯干\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the arms and torsos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那它们是什么样子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从来没有人看到过它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's seen them for a couple of millennia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能召唤那么古老的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Summoning a demon that ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定有人完全了解那些古老的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone really knows their stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为这里有个很厉害的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we got a major player in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么不上去和她亲热还在这里干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you give that girl a private stripogram.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.25,0:15:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你咬我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你去咬她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可别留下齿印哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave teeth marks. Just enough to where.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? You.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I'm-l'm just.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[咒语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[CHANTING lN FOREIGN LANGUAGE]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.57,0:18:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得你还不应该来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那对兄弟还在镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the brothers, they're in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}l didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我会在这里 等着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. l'll be here waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这究竟是什么鬼玩意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.23,0:20:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 我有话和你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I gotta talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 那么美女梅格是召唤daeva的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hot little Meg is summoning the Daeva?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.99,0:20:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来 她好象在用一个黑色的祭坛在控制它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like she was using that black altar to control the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.07,0:20:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来萨姆的感觉是对的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Sammy's got a thing for the bad girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和哪个碗有什么关系呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the deal with that bowl?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在和碗说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She talked into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.67,0:20:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就象女巫和水晶球对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way witches used to scry into crystal balls or entrails.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.77,0:21:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在和某人交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was communicating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.25,0:21:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和daeva吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the Daeva?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你说那些东西是无意识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You said those things were savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是其它的什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this was someone different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.21,0:21:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给她指令的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who's giving her orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即将到达那个仓库的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone…who's coming to that warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本来想和你早点说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I was gonna tell you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.66,0:21:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察局的朋友艾米的确帮了我大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled a favor with my friend Amy over at the police department.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两个死者的完全的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}The complete records of the two victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们刚开始遗漏了某些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We missed something the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.37,0:21:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一个死者 这个老人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first victim, the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从没离开过芝加哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spent his whole life in Chicago…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.55,0:21:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了他的出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he wasn't born here.Look where he was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}堪萨斯州 劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence, Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅雷迪思 第2个死者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Meredith, the second victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是被领养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out she was adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猜猜看她是从那里来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess where she's from.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}堪萨斯州 劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence, Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.18,0:22:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.85,0:22:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是指 那是恶魔杀害妈妈的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is where the demon killed Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.20,0:22:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是所有事情的开端\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where everything started.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.55,0:22:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得梅格和那个魔鬼有关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Meg's tied up with the demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.75,0:22:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得这很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a definite possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.87,0:22:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那和劳伦斯有何关联呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the significance of Lawrence?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.13,0:22:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些daeva又是怎么被召唤的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do these Daeva things fit in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.29,0:22:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.42,0:22:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说我们去毁了那个黑色祭坛 抓住梅格好好的审问她一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we trash that black altar, grab Meg and have an interrogation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.01,0:22:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不行 我们得暗中行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We can't. We shouldn't tip her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要偷偷溜进那个仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta stake out that warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.37,0:22:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去看看到底她要和什么东西见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta see who…or what is showing up to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.11,0:22:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll tell you one thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.64,0:22:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我们两不该单独行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't think we should do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.20,0:22:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们发现了杀害妈妈的重要线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think we got a serious lead on the thing that killed Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.24,0:22:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个仓库 西1435号\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… This warehouse, it's 1435 West Erie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.68,0:22:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 收到消息后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, if you get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.32,0:22:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽快赶来芝加哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to Chicago as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.23,0:22:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}留言？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voice mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.96,0:22:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.09,0:22:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天 你拿了些什么来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez. What'd you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我几乎把车上的东西都拿来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ransacked that trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.16,0:22:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣水 我能想到的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy water, every weapon that I could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.76,0:23:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}针对半打不同宗教的驱魔卷轴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exorcism rituals from about a half dozen religions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.77,0:23:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道会面对什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure what to expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.99,0:23:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我觉得我们该做好各种准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I guess we should just expect everything, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.06,0:23:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚不一般哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你紧张？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.78,0:23:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.10,0:23:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 一点也不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 你能想象我们要是真找对了那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you imagine if we actually found that damn thing? That demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.26,0:23:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别想这么多好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not get ahead of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.25,0:23:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 我只是说 如果真是那样呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know. l'm just saying what if we did?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.71,0:23:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果所有的事真的就在这个晚上结束呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if this whole thing was over tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.79,0:23:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟 我要睡一个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, l'd sleep for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回到学校 重新做人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to school. Just be a person again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.47,0:23:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想重新回到学校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna go back to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.43,0:24:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 当我们杀了那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, once we're done hunting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.01,0:24:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 那样不对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls there something wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.67,0:24:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 那样很好 对你来说很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. It's great. Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.48,0:24:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当这一切都结束 你会去做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean… What are you gonna do when it's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.61,0:24:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远都不会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never gonna be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.76,0:24:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还会有其它的鬼怪事件发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gonna be others. There's gonna be something to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.15,0:24:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总有什么东西等着你去猎杀 可你自己总有为自己考虑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be something you want for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.29,0:24:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想你一结束就马上离开 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't want you to leave the second this thing's over, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.54,0:24:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.21,0:24:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你认为是我拉着你到处跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I drag you everywhere? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.42,0:24:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想想是什么原因让我来斯坦福找你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I came and got you at Stanford?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.62,0:24:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为爸爸遇到了麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Dad was in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为你想找到杀害妈妈的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to find what killed Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.49,0:24:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 是那样 可不止那些原因 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that, but it's more than that, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.32,0:24:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和我还有爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.74,0:24:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我们又重新在一起生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I want us to be together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.14,0:25:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我们重新开始一个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want us to be a family again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.25,0:25:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we are a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.23,0:25:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会为了你做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.20,0:25:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有些事情是回不去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But things will never be the way they were before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.73,0:25:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.22,0:25:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我不想他们回到最初\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want them to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.65,0:25:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会这样过一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna live this life forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.49,0:25:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 当这一切都结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, when this is all over…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.52,0:25:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得让我走自己的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have to let me go my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.36,0:26:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计们 干吗躲躲藏藏象孩子样 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys. Hiding's a little bit childish, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.01,0:26:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这没有逃出我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that didn't work out like l'd planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.95,0:26:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不出来呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.10,0:27:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我必须得说 这对我们的友谊来说是欺骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…l have to say, this puts a real crimp in our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.78,0:27:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 告诉我关于那个恶魔的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.16,0:27:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你那些daeva朋友呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's your little Daeva friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.10,0:27:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.89,0:27:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的那些枪一点用也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shotgun's not gonna do much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.98,0:27:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 别担心 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't worry, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.51,0:27:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}枪可不是用来对付daeva的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shotgun's not for the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.16,0:27:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是谁 梅格？谁要来这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who is it, Meg? Who's coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.78,0:27:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在等谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.89,0:27:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.98,0:28:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 别再犯这样的错了 你这位女朋友是个婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam? Don't take this the wrong way, but your girlfriend is a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.59,0:28:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这所有的一切都是个圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}This…The whole thing was a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.17,0:28:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在酒吧和你遇见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running into you at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.62,0:28:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟踪你到这里 偷听你的对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Following you here hearing what you had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.24,0:28:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这都是设计好的 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all a setup, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.47,0:28:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的死者都是来自劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the victims were from Lawrence?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.16,0:28:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那并不意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.39,0:28:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是为了吸引你 就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt was just to draw you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.12,0:28:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你毫无理由就杀了那两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed those two people for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.03,0:28:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宝贝 我杀过的人多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, l've killed a lot more for a lot less.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.81,0:28:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你设圈套给我们 干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trapped us. Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.28,0:28:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在任你宰割\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Miller time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.20,0:28:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么现在还不动手啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you kill us already?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.50,0:28:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没必要这样着急吧 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not very quick on the uptake, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.61,0:28:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陷阱又不是为你设的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This trap isn't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.46,0:28:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.31,0:29:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是给爸爸设的圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trap for Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.55,0:29:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 甜心 你没你看起来那么聪明哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sweetheart, you're dumber than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.11,0:29:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他现在不在城里 即使他在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because even if Dad was in town, which he is not…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.25,0:29:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也不会中你们的圈套 他精于此道\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wouldn't walk into this. He's too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.63,0:29:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是很厉害 我也会证明给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is pretty good, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.71,0:29:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you see…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.77,0:29:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有个弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}he has one weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.83,0:29:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.65,0:29:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.34,0:29:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他小心翼翼的保护着他的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lets his guard down around his boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.54,0:29:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他的情绪干扰了他的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lets his emotions cloud his judgments.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.18,0:29:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚好知道他到城里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I happen to know he is in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.74,0:29:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且他会来救你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'll come and try to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.07,0:29:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚好知道他到城里了 他会过来救你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I happen to know he is in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.84,0:29:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个时候daeva会杀了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the Daevas will kill everybody…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.14,0:29:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}漂亮的 慢慢的 一地都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}nice and slow and messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.09,0:30:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我必须得和你说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.81,0:30:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就凭几个影子是杀不了他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna take a lot more than some shadow to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.33,0:30:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些daeva就在这个房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the Daevas are in the room here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.31,0:30:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看不到它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.41,0:30:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你唯一能看到只是它们的影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their shadows are the only part you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.94,0:30:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么要这么做 Meg？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you doing this, Meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.53,0:30:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你又能获得什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of deal you got worked out here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.54,0:30:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和谁呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with who?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.11,0:30:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和你一样为着同样的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this for the same reasons you do what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.39,0:30:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.23,0:30:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.68,0:30:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像你对你妈妈 还有杰茜的爱一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the love you have for Mommy. And Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.14,0:30:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚回你的地狱里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.90,0:30:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宝贝 我早就在那里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, l'm already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.33,0:30:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.45,0:30:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没必要彼此态度那么恶劣\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need to be nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.45,0:30:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为我们彼此都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we both know…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.17,0:30:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对我的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}how you really feel about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.74,0:30:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.09,0:31:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到你 在看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}l saw you watching me…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.71,0:31:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在房间里换衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}changing in my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.34,0:31:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那让你兴奋 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turned you on, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.44,0:31:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们两个外面去开个房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a room, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.76,0:31:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}l didn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.07,0:31:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢你看着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked that you were watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.89,0:31:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.99,0:31:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能找点乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I can still have a little dirty fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.67,0:31:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想找乐子？继续啊 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna have fun? Go ahead then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.57,0:31:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我现在有点累\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little tied up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.76,0:32:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想转移我的注意力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, were you just trying to distract me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.42,0:32:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后你哥哥可以逃脱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}While your brother cuts free?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.37,0:32:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.13,0:32:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.83,0:32:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我自己也有刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was because I have a knife of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.85,0:32:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.83,0:32:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毁了那个祭坛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.40,0:32:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.28,0:32:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.59,0:33:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想那些daeva不是那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess the Daevas didn't like being bossed around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.31,0:33:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.92,0:33:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.70,0:33:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.23,0:33:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别再找这样疯狂的女人 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get laid find a girl that's not so buckets of crazy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.05,0:33:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么不把那些东西留在车里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just leave that stuff in the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.20,0:33:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说过 我还是要说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it before and I'll say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.92,0:33:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有总比没好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better safe than sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.30,0:33:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.42,0:33:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.75,0:33:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.67,0:34:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.30,0:34:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.36,0:34:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 那是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, it was a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.85,0:34:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know. l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.67,0:34:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事 我也想过可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I thought it might have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.05,0:34:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在那里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you there? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.70,0:34:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我到那里的时候刚好看到她掉下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got there just in time to see the girl take the swan dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.36,0:34:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她就是那个凶手 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the bad guy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.35,0:34:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.11,0:34:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好样的 好的 这没什么奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Well, it doesn't surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.15,0:34:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前它试图阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tried to stop me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.85,0:34:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个恶魔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon has?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.62,0:34:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我很接近了 它知道我要杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It knows l'm close. It knows l'm gonna kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.35,0:35:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是驱魔或是把它送回地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just exorcise it or send it back to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.66,0:35:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真真实实的杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.39,0:35:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么样呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.53,0:35:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正在实施\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.22,0:35:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们一起 我们能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let us come with you. We'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.22,0:35:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.86,0:35:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.78,0:35:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 希望你们能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, try to understand…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.02,0:35:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个恶魔凶狠狡诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}this demon is a scary son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.51,0:35:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想你们冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you in the crossfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.69,0:35:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更不想你们受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.34,0:35:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 你不用担心这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you don't have to worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.33,0:35:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当然会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.03,0:35:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是你们的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.95,0:35:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 萨姆 上次我们在一起的时候吵得很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Sammy, last time we were together we had one hell of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.22,0:35:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.15,0:35:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.14,0:35:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好长的时间啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.52,0:36:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.30,0:36:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.32,0:37:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.16,0:37:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些是影子恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things are shadow demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.39,0:37:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们用光来照射\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's light them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.15,0:37:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.27,0:37:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.93,0:38:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 来吧 我们时间不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on. We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.25,0:38:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当光熄灭 他们会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as the flare's out, they'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.38,0:38:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等 等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.60,0:38:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.11,0:38:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 你不能和我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you can't come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.45,0:38:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.00,0:38:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子们 你们要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys… You're beat to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.33,0:38:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.46,0:38:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 我们要在一起 我们追踪这些恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we should stick together.We'll go after this demon together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.84,0:38:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.42,0:38:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在这里差点害死了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We almost got Dad killed in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.72,0:38:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不知道吗？他们不会罢休\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you understand? They're not gonna stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.06,0:38:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会卷土重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.78,0:38:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会利用我们来抓住爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna use us to get to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.26,0:38:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的意思是梅格是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Meg was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.10,0:38:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当爸爸和我们在一起 他要危险得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's vulnerable when he's with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.07,0:38:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他… 没有我们 他更强壮 不易受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's stronger without us around.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.96,0:38:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.12,0:38:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.21,0:39:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.18,0:39:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我们找寻你这么久后 求你不要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all the time we've spent looking for you…Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.02,0:39:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要加入这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}l gotta be a part of this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.62,0:39:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 这场战争才刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, this fight is just starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.59,0:39:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都有我们各自该面对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are all gonna have a part to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.18,0:39:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now, you gotta trust me, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.42,0:39:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 你必须得让我离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? You gotta let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.87,0:40:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心点 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.95,0:40:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
